{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"72b9eb85a3ad2f992e4ca9146d386d1d93144dad82ed9d64c331d4e54236b1c8","ja":"後日、歌番組の収録があって……","zh":"过几天有音乐节目的录制……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"04ea26668cea73e9288cafddf1d58268f999fc02f686471470d1988a71224806","ja":"みんな、おつかれさま～！\n今日の歌番組の収録、大成功だったわね！","zh":"大家辛苦啦～！\n今天音乐节目的录制非常成功呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b2b4f621de89fd344983066efb227fdf064b38119eb5de959ee8dda794ce5929","ja":"千早が教えてくれたトレーニングのおかげで、\n今までよりいっぱい声が出せた気がするぞ！","zh":"多亏了千早教给我的训练方法，\n感觉比以往更能放开嗓子发声了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a2f1e05199ffb4549bef8cd9a4054883c6affa63048b57257eafb26ae5d6b0b8","ja":"私も、真ちゃんのメニューのおかげで、\n激しいダンスにもついていけたわ♪","zh":"多亏了小真的训练方案，\n我也能跟上激烈的舞蹈了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"311069fa03757d00fd432ce5dd0ee3e885051a6f9487bd4f0cfbdc1bc4c90ff4","ja":"そうですね。全体的に\nかなり底上げができたかと。","zh":"确实呢。整体水平\n应该得到了相当大的提升。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"92c59bd76723e36add3876a0b5349a25170b30787dd72868a6a20be50db64a91","ja":"みんなで意見を出し合って作った\nトレーニングメニューのお陰だよね！","zh":"多亏了大家一起出谋划策制定的\n训练方案呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d0a29d8119d925e3b3a673c8703a5af985074848e6d4d93407abc8656d3a3e4d","ja":"ええ。改めて、他の人の意見や考え方を\n知ることが大切って分かったわ。","zh":"嗯。我再次体会到了解其他人的\n意见与想法是多么重要。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9ec8f70af4e91db21891743fb4aa6efd5627a58656eb6e46115267a84c69d0b7","ja":"それじゃあ、自分たちがまだ鍛えられてない\nところを見つけて、トレーニングしたら……。","zh":"那么，要是找到自己尚未锻炼到的\n地方，加以训练的话……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"9c35e0d26bfe4f6f3535f399fcce5008598244de3c9633767bc75d170fa1a7dc","ja":"アイドルとして、もっと上を目指すことが\nできるかもしれない、ってことね♪","zh":"也就是说，作为偶像，说不定能够\n向着更高处迈进呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bc990abfb69c959779c5f8ebd0c6616bf3f9458ac124423d479ef6054cb98de8","ja":"すごいぞ！　ねえねえ、\nあずささんは、何かいいトレーニング知らない？","zh":"好厉害啊！呐呐，\n梓小姐知不知道什么好的训练方法？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"10b332b553c01a945af6d78307cb15e5ec68a9211fe4232ee46842af425b4bd2","ja":"そうね～……。\n美容のためにしている体操、なんてどうかしら？","zh":"让我想想～……\n为了美容而做的体操，这个怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b45feb3ead14555aa81513772dd0fa68e46786c4a045cb4be0ac0e4d95a12341","ja":"響ちゃんは？","zh":"小响呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"86ab1a5f15954baca42197bd75ea8dee318b81204314f34124d8446aff940b26","ja":"自分は動物たちと全力で遊ぶことかな。\nとっさの判断力とかも鍛えられると思うぞ！","zh":"我平时大概会全力和动物们一起玩吧。\n感觉也能锻炼到瞬间的判断力呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"d9482b9b19240c842cd83b266e9feec9e979a461c29b3197ece24fb16b6a9a0f","ja":"よーし！　ダンスも歌も上手で、いつでも的確な判断が\nできて、とびっきりかわいいアイドルになるぞー！","zh":"好嘞！我要成为不仅唱跳俱佳、随时都能做出精准判断，\n而且还无比可爱的偶像——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1435.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"145b2b9c5ea0ad36c8206cbea93f55b4a429d488fabf4cb3cb3eb1257daed18a","ja":"ふふっ、とても欲張りな目標ね。\nでもみんなで頑張ったら、きっと。","zh":"呵呵，真是个贪心的目标呢。\n不过要是大家一起努力的话，一定能实现的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
